      "source_checked_date": "2026-11-17",
      "scope_note": "Negative days are relative to stem-cell infusion, not ordinary chemotherapy day numbers. No routine q28 scheduling or automatic maintenance oral etoposide. NCCP supplies no numerical neutrophil/platelet starting cut-off for this conditioning pathway. Do not import outpatient chemotherapy cut-offs. Daily FBC, renal/liver profile, fluid balance and weights; baseline pulmonary tests, echocardiogram, LDH/urate, virology and measured GFR preference. Irradiated cellular blood components from one week before conditioning until 12 months after stem-cell infusion. PJP prophylaxis: no co-trimoxazole before engraftment; source continuation to day 100 or CD4>200 requires transplant-team interpretation."
    },
